  "content": "[Intro]\n[F]\n[Gm]\n[F]\n[Gm]I see\n\n[Verse 1]\n[F]trees of green...\n[Am]\n[Bb]red roses too\n[Am]\n[Gm]I see 'em bloom...\n[F]\n[A7]for me and you\n[Dm]And I\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#sus2]think to myself...\n[C#]\n[Bb/D]what a\n[C7]wonderful world...\n[F]\n[B7b5]\n[Bbmaj7]\n[C7]I see\n\n[Verse 2]\n[F]skies of blue...\n[Am]\n[Bb]and clouds of white\n[Am]\n[Gm]The bright blessed day...\n[F]\n[A7]dark sacred night\n[Dm]And I\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#sus2]think to myself...\n[C#]\n[Bb/D]what a\n[C7]wonderful world...\n[F]\n[Gm]\n[Gm]\n[F][C]The\n\n[Bridge]\n[Bb/C]colors of a rainbow...\n[C7]so\n[F]pretty... in the sky\nAre\n[Gm]also on the faces...\n[C7]of\n[F]people... going by\nI see\n[Dm]friends shaking hands...\n[C/E]sayin...\n[Dm/F]how do you do\n[C/E]\n[Dm/F]They're really sa-\n[D#dim/F#]yin...\n[Gm]I [Bb/D]love yo-\n[C7]u... I hear\n\n[Verse 3]\n[F]babies cryin...\n[Am]\n[Bb]I watch them grow\n[Am]\n[Gm]They'll learn much more...\n[F]\n[A7]than I'll never know\n[Dm]And I\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#sus2]think to myself...\n[C#]\n[Bb/D]what a\n[C7]wonderful world\n[F]\n[D#7]\n[D7]Yes\nI\n\n[Ending]\n[Gm7]think to myself...\n[C7b9]what a\nwonderful\nworld\n[F]Oh\nYeah",
